ient_msg_id":"4d3f30ca-1e9a-4185-b80e-8a0915cfb924","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"変形で相転移してるらしいですね。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1414937576570441728\u003e","ts":"1626186546.229800","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Science_Release|@Science_Release\u003e: 良く調べてみると、力が加わった氷は、普通に観られるIh相という結晶構造から、より高圧で観られるII相へと一部変化していた事が分かったんだよ！この結晶構造の変化が、曲げるのも伸ばすのも自在の、柔軟な変形の一部を担っている可能性があるよ！","id":1,"author_name":"彩恵りり (科学系ニュース解説アカウント)","author_subname":"@Science_Release","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1414937576570441728","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1409486885290799104/skO5s3Nk_normal.jpg","text":"良く調べてみると、力が加わった氷は、普通に観られるIh相という結晶構造から、より高圧で観られるII相へと一部変化していた事が分かったんだよ！この結晶構造の変化が、曲げるのも伸ばすのも自在の、柔軟な変形の一部を担っている可能性があるよ！","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1626182381,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1414937576570441728","original_url":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1414937576570441728"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8rgD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4b69051-18bf-446c-a7c9-b4af43e14d87","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"てか氷の相って調べてみるとめっちゃある\n教科書で見たような並びの相じゃないのかもしれないな","ts":"1626185047.229500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J6DJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a823f649-0072-455a-9d81-73f37e769093","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"分子同士適度に離れてて結合先が定まってるからこうなるのかな","ts":"1626185016.228700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"djwm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ac613cf-6959-4913-acf0-357e37b4f150","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"水素結合って不思議","ts":"1626184978.227600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x8p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad61ad85-9d17-4483-a180-8438248c1cfc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"こちらの方が読みやすい人もいそうなのでぺたり","ts":"1626182553.226700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S4Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b868004-2913-4fe4-8baa-b6325c48c204","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"上に貼られたやつだ \u003chttps://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1414937552797278211\u003e","ts":"1626182531.226300","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Science_Release|@Science_Release\u003e: 氷を完全に近い結晶として細い糸状に凍らせると、これがぐにゃぐにゃに曲がる事が初めて実験で明らかになったよ！氷は理論的には柔軟な物質である事を証明する研究だよ！リプで解説するね！\n\nPeizhen Xu, et al. \"Elastic ice microfibers\". Science, 373 (6551) 187-192. \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/E6LdzvXWQAYMbqJ.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"彩恵りり (科学系ニュース解説アカウント)","author_subname":"@Science_Release","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1414937552797278211","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1409486885290799104/skO5s3Nk_normal.jpg","text":"氷を完全に近い結晶として細い糸状に凍らせると、これがぐにゃぐにゃに曲がる事が初めて実験で明らかになったよ！氷は理論的には柔軟な物質である事を証明する研究だよ！リプで解説するね！\n\nPeizhen Xu, et al. \"Elastic ice microfibers\". Science, 373 (6551) 187-192.","thumb_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/E6LdzvXWQAYMbqJ.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1626182375,"service_name":"twitter","thumb_width":852,"thumb_height":479,"video_html":"\u003cvideo autoplay loop muted poster=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/E6LdzvXWQAYMbqJ.jpg\" width=\"852\" height=\"480\"\u003e\u003csource type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://video.twimg.com/tweet_video/E6LdzvXWQAYMbqJ.mp4\"\u003e\u003c/video\u003e","video_html_width":852,"video_html_height":480,"from_url":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1414937552797278211","original_url":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1414937552797278211"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NCjyd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d15af76f-69d9-4380-909d-85808774d8ac","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"すごいくらい:gunnyari: 行ってるな","ts":"1626125781.225500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wublS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82ab03c3-0cd3-48f0-be36-0bb334585d2e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"動画がめっちゃ衝撃的\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/NazologyInfo/status/1414540540213964803?s=19|https://twitter.com/NazologyInfo/status/1414540540213964803?s=19\u003e","ts":"1626125451.225000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/NazologyInfo|@NazologyInfo\u003e: ぐにゃりと曲がる「柔らかい氷」を作ることに成功\n\u003chttps://nazology.net/archives/92535\u003e\n\n氷は固いという概念が覆りました。中国の浙江大が針金のような不思議な氷を作成。実は理論的にきれいな氷の結晶は柔軟性をもつと分かっていて、今回製氷法を見直すことでその柔軟性を実現しました。なんともクールな研究です \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/E6FHJZsUUAce2Nk.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"科学ニュースメディア@ナゾロジー","author_subname":"@NazologyInfo","author_link":"https://twitter.com/NazologyInfo/status/1414540540213964803","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1338732185457573888/RczATbgt_normal.png","text":"ぐにゃりと曲がる「柔らかい氷」を作ることに成功\n\u003chttps://nazology.net/archives/92535\u003e\n\n氷は固いという概念が覆りました。中国の浙江大が針金のような不思議な氷を作成。実は理論的にきれいな氷の結晶は柔軟性をもつと分かっていて、今回製氷法を見直すことでその柔軟性を実現しました。なんともクールな研究です","thumb_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/E6FHJZsUUAce2Nk.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1626087720,"service_name":"twitter","thumb_width":479,"thumb_height":328,"video_html":"\u003cvideo autoplay loop muted poster=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/E6FHJZsUUAce2Nk.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"328\"\u003e\u003csource type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://video.twimg.com/tweet_video/E6FHJZsUUAce2Nk.mp4\"\u003e\u003c/video\u003e","video_html_width":480,"video_html_height":328,"from_url":"https://twitter.com/NazologyInfo/status/1414540540213964803?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/NazologyInfo/status/1414540540213964803?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gunnyari","count":5,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UKHUVMBJR","UD1FQV38V","UL6CFN8NR","U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g=Ku4"}]}]
